    "detailed_description": "Summer Vacation is here and the main problem is find a good way to spend it. So, you decide to embark on an adventure!!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Enjoy the different levels and their challenges</strong> Jump and Dodge to advance the levels and save the forest.<br></li><li> <strong>Master your jumping skills</strong> Master the ancient art of jumping obstacles and beat the cute enemy!<br></li><li> <strong>Enjoy a simple, engaging and fun story</strong> It's Summer Vacation! there is no time to be serious when you must save the forest, and in the process make a posible case of destruction of private property, <br></li><li> <strong>A challenging adventure awaits</strong> Have fun beating the levels, destroy every enemy that try to stop you from reaching your objectives!</li></ul>",
